{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "EPH",
  "chapter": 3,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this cause, I Paul, the prisoner of Jesus Christ for you Gentiles,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ye have heard of the dispensation of the grace of God which is given me on your account.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That by revelation he made known to me the mystery, as I wrote before in few words;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By which when ye read, ye may understand my knowledge in the mystery of Christ,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which in other ages was not made known to the sons of men, as it is now revealed to his holy apostles and prophets by the Spirit;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That the Gentiles should be joint-heirs, and of the same body, and partakers of his promise in Christ by the Gospel:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of which I was made a minister, according to the gift of the grace of God given to me by the effectual working of his power.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To me, who am less than the least of all saints, is this grace given, that I should preach among the Gentiles the unsearchable riches of Christ;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And to make all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " see what is the fellowship of the mystery, which from the beginning of the world hath been hid in God, who created all things by Jesus Christ:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the intent that now to the principalities and powers in heavenly ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "places",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " might be known by the church the manifold wisdom of God,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "According to the eternal purpose which he purposed in Christ Jesus our Lord:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In whom we have boldness and access with confidence by the faith of him,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore I desire that ye faint not at my tribulations for you, which is your glory.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this cause I bow my knees to the Father of our Lord Jesus Christ,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of whom the whole family in heaven and earth is named,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That he would grant you according to the riches of his glory to be strengthened with might by his Spirit in the inner man;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That Christ may dwell in your hearts by faith; that ye, being rooted and grounded in love,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "May be able to comprehend with all saints what ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the breadth, and length, and depth, and highth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And to know the love of Christ, which passeth knowledge, that ye may be filled with all the fullness of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now to him that is able to do exceeding abundantly above all that we ask or think, according to the power that worketh in us.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EPH.3.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EPH.3.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To him ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory in the church by Christ Jesus throughout all ages, world without end. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
